01b[K\r\nNo VM guests are running outdated hypervisor (qemu) binaries on this host.\u001b[K\r\nubuntu@primary:~$ candump vcan0\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[19;19H\u001b[?2026l"]
